<title>THAILAND: Krung Thai raises deposit, lending rates.</title>
<headline>Krung Thai raises deposit, lending rates.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Krung Thai Bank Plc said on Thursday it raised its fixed deposit rates 200-225 basis points and its lending rates 100 basis points, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Krung Thai said it increased its fixed deposit rates to 10.00-11.50 percent from 8.00-9.25.</p>
<p>The bank's minimum lending rates (MLR) also rose to 13.75 percent from 12.75 while its minimum overdraft rate (MOR) was raised to 14.25 percent from 13.25.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-6520642</p>
</text>
